WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.170
- Before we say goodbye,

00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:03.060
we'd like to play a quick round of-

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:03.893
- Drewth or Dare.

00:00:03.893 --> 00:00:05.176
- Mm-hmm.
- Mm-hmm.

00:00:05.176 --> 00:00:07.090
(audience cheers)

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.280
Okay, alright, so what's it gonna be?

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:11.250
Drewth or Dare, and
please say it together.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.083
- [Both] Dare.

00:00:12.083 --> 00:00:13.170
- [Ross] Okay!

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:14.670
Alright, so we'll do anything.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:15.540
- Yeah we will.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.500
- Alright, what's it gonna be?

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.780
- So we love playing games.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.930
And so we wanted to challenge you and Ross

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:24.900
to the Junk in the Trunk Challenge.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.640
- Yeah, so we have tissue boxes

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.162
filled with ping pongs
(audience laughs)

00:00:28.162 --> 00:00:29.730
right behind you.
- Oh, okay.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:30.563
Wait, they're-
- You just tie them

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:31.710
around your waist.

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.000
- Yeah, just like that.
- Towards the back?

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:33.930
- [Audience Member] Yes, the tissue box

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.624
should be in the back.

00:00:35.624 --> 00:00:36.457
- Okay.
- Yes.

00:00:36.457 --> 00:00:38.340
- And then-
(audience laughing)

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.230
To tie it, Drew, in the front.

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:41.602
- I'm working on it.

00:00:41.602 --> 00:00:44.220
(all laughing)

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.690
I like how bossy you are.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.670
- Yeah.
(audience laughing)

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:49.560
- I like it. Keep it coming, honey.

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:52.560
- Okay, so then you're
gonna shake that booty.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:53.670
- [Both] Okay.

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:55.680
- And you have 30 seconds.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:58.230
The one who gets the
most out is the winner.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:00:59.340
- Okay.

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:00.450
- Now we're gonna count you down.

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:01.283
- [Ross] Okay great.

00:01:01.283 --> 00:01:03.870
- Ready?
- Three, two-

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:05.330
- [Both] One.
(upbeat music)

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:06.865
- Shake it up!
(audience cheering)

00:01:06.865 --> 00:01:10.627
Go Ross!
(all cheering)

00:01:10.627 --> 00:01:12.848
Come on now, shake it off!

00:01:12.848 --> 00:01:17.848
(all cheering, applauding)
(upbeat music)

00:01:21.778 --> 00:01:22.611
Go Ross!

00:01:23.712 --> 00:01:24.879
Come on, Ross!

00:01:25.827 --> 00:01:27.327
Woo, shake it off!

00:01:30.563 --> 00:01:31.396
Who won?

00:01:32.577 --> 00:01:35.577
(audience cheering)

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.140
- Alright.
- I am telling you.

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:41.520
I don't think I got any out.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.170
- You did! These are all yours.

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:44.003
- Yeah but-

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:44.836
- How many are in there still?

00:01:44.836 --> 00:01:46.680
Can I take a look?
- It was hard.

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:47.820
- Let me see.

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:49.830
Oh, she's got, oh, well hi.

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:52.350
She's got two, four, six, seven in there.

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:54.090
How many do I have left?

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.980
- Oh my god, I'm so, none!

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:59.133
- Yes.
(audience cheering)

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:02.495
- Good job, both of you.

00:02:02.495 --> 00:02:05.502
(audience cheering)

00:02:05.502 --> 00:02:06.690
- Well, what's it gonna be?

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:07.523
Drewth or Dare?

00:02:07.523 --> 00:02:09.694
- It is a dare.
- Okay.

00:02:09.694 --> 00:02:11.030
- Okay, you ready?
- You know I'm willing

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.090
to do anything.

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:12.930
- Anything at all?

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:14.340
- Yes!
- Alright.

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:16.320
So, I do a little bit of working out.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.760
I don't do a lot.
- Okay.

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:19.380
- Don't have the best upper body strength,

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:22.110
so I thought maybe we can
share this experience together.

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:22.943
- I love it.

00:02:22.943 --> 00:02:24.720
- Let's do pushups.
- Okay!

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:25.553
- What do you think?

00:02:25.553 --> 00:02:26.386
- Let's try it!

00:02:26.386 --> 00:02:27.780
- Now, do you want to do lady pushups,

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.250
or do you want to do the actual pushups?

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.260
- I'll probably go for lady pushups.

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:32.093
- Alright.

00:02:32.093 --> 00:02:33.358
Do you want to do it together, or-

00:02:33.358 --> 00:02:35.190
- Yeah, let's do it together!
- Okay, cool.

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:36.778
- Okay.

00:02:36.778 --> 00:02:38.812
- You ready?
(suspenseful music)

00:02:38.812 --> 00:02:39.705
Just keep going.
(audience applause)

00:02:39.705 --> 00:02:40.538
- Ready.

00:02:43.525 --> 00:02:45.358
- [Audience] One, two,

00:02:46.455 --> 00:02:47.880
three,

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:49.224
four,

00:02:49.224 --> 00:02:50.057
five,

00:02:51.059 --> 00:02:52.710
six,

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:55.142
seven.
- Are you feeling it?

00:02:55.142 --> 00:02:57.091
- Yes.
- [Audience] Eight.

00:02:57.091 --> 00:02:57.924
Nine.

00:02:59.841 --> 00:03:01.500
10.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:02.581
- Do you want to keep going,

00:03:02.581 --> 00:03:04.165
or you had enough?

00:03:04.165 --> 00:03:06.149
(suspenseful music resumes)
(Beth laughing)

00:03:06.149 --> 00:03:07.459
- [Audience] 11,

00:03:07.459 --> 00:03:08.500
12,

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.036
13,

00:03:10.036 --> 00:03:10.869
14,

00:03:12.148 --> 00:03:12.981
15,

00:03:14.196 --> 00:03:15.029
16,

00:03:16.254 --> 00:03:17.087
17,

00:03:18.058 --> 00:03:18.891
18,

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:21.003
19,

00:03:21.886 --> 00:03:22.719
20.

00:03:25.545 --> 00:03:28.042
(audience applause)
(both sighing)

00:03:28.042 --> 00:03:33.042
- That was enough?
(all clapping)

00:03:34.302 --> 00:03:35.646
- Thank you, Beth.

00:03:35.646 --> 00:03:37.915
(audience applause)

00:03:37.915 --> 00:03:39.780
- Okay, is it gonna be a Drewth or a Dare?

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.250
- It's going to be a dare.

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.960
- Okay!
(audience applause)

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:45.840
We've never said no
before, so bring it on.

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:47.610
- Okay, you ready?
- Yeah.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:50.070
- I love sour foods.

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:52.680
I dare you to eat a quarter of a lemon,

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:55.110
while keeping a total Poker face.

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.730
- I love this dare!

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:58.380
Do you have a lemon?

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.821
- Someone does!

00:03:59.821 --> 00:04:01.080
(audience laughing)

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:01.913
- [Both] Oh!

00:04:01.913 --> 00:04:03.510
- We just found some on the desk.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:05.583
- Okay, three, two, go.

00:04:10.568 --> 00:04:13.568
(audience laughing)

00:04:17.979 --> 00:04:20.040
- Oh god, I failed!

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:23.040
(audience applause)

00:04:25.177 --> 00:04:26.940
I now want to see more people do this,

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.380
and see who can and can't,

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:31.983
'cause it was impossible
not to make the pickle face.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:35.070
- It's a new TikTok challenge.

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:36.123
Try it at home, try it at home.

00:04:36.123 --> 00:04:38.190
- Hey!
- Let's start one.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:40.072
- Let's do it.
- Let's do it right now!

00:04:40.072 --> 00:04:41.032
- Yeah!
(audience applause)

00:04:41.032 --> 00:04:42.760
#LemonFace.

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:46.650
- We challenge you to a TikTok challenge.

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:48.750
Can you eat a lemon

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:51.420
and keep a straight face?

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:52.761
I'll tell you, I couldn't do it.

00:04:52.761 --> 00:04:55.594
(uplifting music)

